sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Platform as rhods-operator
    participant User as User / Kubeflow SDK / Dashboard
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Op as trainer-operator<br/>8443/TCP metrics
    participant CM as kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager<br/>9443 webhook / 8443 metrics
    participant JS as JobSet controller<br/>(JobSet Operator)
    participant Pod as Training pods<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)

    rect rgb(235, 243, 252)
    Note over Platform,CM: Flow 1 - Platform enables Trainer
    Platform->>API: Create Trainer default-trainer + ConfigMap odh-trainer-config<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    Op->>API: Watch Trainer, check OLM jobset-operator,<br/>JobSetOperator/cluster, JobSet CRD
    alt JobSet Operator missing or unhealthy
        Op->>API: Set Trainer status Degraded
    else Dependencies OK
        Op->>API: Read APIServer TLS profile
        Op->>API: SSA apply CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, webhooks,<br/>ClusterTrainingRuntimes, ImageStreams
    end
    CM->>API: cert-controller writes kubeflow-trainer-webhook-cert,<br/>injects caBundle into webhook configs
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 235)
    Note over User,Pod: Flow 2 - User submits a TrainJob
    User->>API: Create TrainJob<br/>HTTPS/6443, user bearer token / OAuth
    API->>CM: Admission review (mutate + validate)<br/>HTTPS svc 443 to 9443, TLS cluster profile
    CM-->>API: Allowed (runtimePatches timestamps defaulted)
    CM->>API: Create JobSet, ConfigMaps, Secrets,<br/>PodGroup, NetworkPolicy (SA token)
    JS->>API: Create Jobs / Pods
    CM->>API: Watch JobSet status, update TrainJob status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over CM,Pod: Flow 3 - RHAI progression tracking
    CM->>API: List Pods of TrainJob
    CM->>Pod: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/28080 plaintext, no auth<br/>(NetworkPolicy-restricted)
    Pod-->>CM: Progress JSON
    CM->>API: Patch TrainJob annotation<br/>trainer.opendatahub.io/trainerStatus
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 250)
    Note over Prom,CM: Flow 4 - Metrics scraping
    Prom->>CM: GET /metrics HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (CA from webhook cert), Bearer to TokenReview/SAR
    CM-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (service-ca), Bearer to TokenReview/SAR
    Op-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end
